, spells and hundreds of unique stats!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deep Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376610/extras/ea7daf4434704e2d790ef956e0fcbbae.poster.avif?t=1766972741\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376610/extras/ea7daf4434704e2d790ef956e0fcbbae.webm?t=1766972741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376610/extras/ea7daf4434704e2d790ef956e0fcbbae.mp4?t=1766972741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore randomized maps shrouded in fog of war, full of monsters and treasures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock harder Zones to explore by killing Pinnacle bosses at the end of your explorations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Zone has its own distinct theme, with its own enemies and bosses to conquer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock Masteries as you play, allowing you to further specialize your teams for future explorations!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Headless"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376610/a11adadc23a5c7703dbff7dc64c61d28cba52195/header.jpg?t=1766972741","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2376610/1060784577/eacd6f4548badbab4f5